00:22:52,149 --> 00:22:58,390
And trust has high quality building blocks that make building distributed systems work.

332
00:22:58,390 --> 00:23:06,711
And probably it would be impossible for us to achieve the same quality with the same sized team. if we decided to use C or C++.

